<view class="page"><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="card">{{error}}<button bindtap="retry">重试</button></view><view wx:if="{{accessMessage}}" class="card">{{accessMessage}}<button data-url="/pages/account/index" bindtap="go"><image class="feature-entry-icon" src="/images/ui/edit.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>账号与身份</text></button></view><view wx:if="{{form}}" class="card"><view class="title">{{form.id?'编辑活动':'新建活动'}}</view><view wx:if="{{!canEdit}}">当前身份只读</view><input disabled="{{!canEdit}}" data-key="form.title" value="{{form.title}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="活动标题" maxlength="60"/><picker disabled="{{!canEdit}}" range="{{typeLabels}}" data-key="type" bindchange="select"><view>活动类型：{{form.type}}（点击选择）</view></picker><input disabled="{{!canHQ}}" data-key="form.city" value="{{form.city}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="城市，all为全国；非总部自动使用本城"/><picker mode="date" disabled="{{!canEdit}}" value="{{form.start}}" data-key="form.start" bindchange="input"><view>开始 {{form.start}}</view></picker><picker mode="date" disabled="{{!canEdit}}" value="{{form.end}}" data-key="form.end" bindchange="input"><view>结束 {{form.end}}</view></picker><picker mode="date" disabled="{{!canEdit}}" value="{{form.claimUntil}}" data-key="form.claimUntil" bindchange="input"><view>领取截止 {{form.claimUntil}}</view></picker><picker disabled="{{!canEdit}}" range="{{['全部达标档可领','仅最高达标档']}}" data-key="claimMode" bindchange="select"><view>领取方式 {{form.claimMode === 'highest'?'仅最高档':'全部达标档'}}</view></picker></view><view wx:for="{{form.tiers}}" wx:key="index" class="card"><view class="title">奖励档位 {{index+1}}</view><input disabled="{{!canEdit}}" data-key="form.tiers.{{index}}.name" value="{{item.name}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="档位名称"/><input disabled="{{!canEdit}}" type="number" data-key="form.tiers.{{index}}.target" value="{{item.target}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="达标目标"/><view>奖励名额</view><input disabled="{{!canEdit}}" type="number" data-key="form.tiers.{{index}}.quota" value="{{item.quota}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="奖励名额"/><view>每人限领次数（1–1000）</view><input disabled="{{!canEdit}}" type="number" data-key="form.tiers.{{index}}.perUserLimit" value="{{item.perUserLimit||1}}" bindinput="input"/><picker disabled="{{!canEdit}}" range="{{['会员权益','实物礼品','其他产品']}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindchange="rewardType"><view>奖励类型 {{item.rewardType}}</view></picker><picker wx:if="{{item.rewardType === 'member'}}" disabled="{{!canEdit}}" range="{{planNames}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindchange="plan"><view>选择已上架套餐：{{item.planId}}（点击选择）</view></picker><input wx:else disabled="{{!canEdit}}" data-key="form.tiers.{{index}}.productName" value="{{item.productName}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="实物 / 产品名称"/><view wx:if="{{item.snapshot}}" class="muted">原奖励快照：{{item.snapshot.name}} · 修订{{item.snapshot.revision}}；保存会以所选上架套餐重新生成快照，已产生领取的活动不可改档。</view><button wx:if="{{canEdit}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="removeTier">移除此档</button></view><view wx:if="{{canEdit && form}}" class="card"><button bindtap="addTier">新增档位</button><view wx:if="{{canHQ}}">保存时上线 <switch checked="{{form.published}}" data-key="form.published" bindchange="input"/></view><button bindtap="save">{{canHQ?'保存活动 / 草稿':'保存并提交总部审批'}}</button><view>各档目标不得重复，开始 ≤ 结束 ≤ 领取截止；下架套餐不可选择。</view></view></view>